\title{multised.engine: Build and Analyse the MULTISED Marine Sediment Database}
\description{
Assembles a database of marine-sediment trace-element measurements from five external sources (Mareano, Vannmiljoe, ICES-DOME, MUDAB and 4Demon), harmonises them into a common schema, and progressively quality-controls the result through five database generations: pilot, slim, clean, merged and refined. Also provides the analyses run on the finished databases, covering grain size, iron and aluminium normalisation, organic carbon, spatial and temporal coverage, outlier flagging, and pristine background classification.
